{# List row (<li>, spec §4), embed with a trailing slot; use inside _list. Params:
   title (string, required); href (string|null, default null: the title link covers the whole row via a stretched ::after);
   meta (string|null, default null); meta_variant (string 'default'|'danger'|'low', default 'default');
   lead (string 'avatar'|'date'|'none', default 'none'); initials (string, for lead 'avatar');
   date_weekday (string, e.g. 'THU', for lead 'date'); date_day (string|int, for lead 'date');
   chevron (bool, default true when href is set, else false; drawn last, decorative).
   Block: row_trailing (chips, buttons). Trailing controls sit outside the link and above its stretched area,
   so there are no nested interactive elements.
   Call: {% embed 'components/_list_row.html.twig' with {title: s.name, href: path('student_show', {id: s.id}), lead: 'avatar', initials: s.initials} only %}{% block row_trailing %}…{% endblock %}{% endembed %} #}
{% set href = href|default(null) %}
{% set meta = meta|default(null) %}
{% set lead = lead|default('none') %}
{% set chevron = chevron ?? (href is not null) %}
<li class="list-row list-row--lead-{{ lead }}{{ href ? ' list-row--link' }}">
    {%- if lead == 'avatar' %}
        {% include 'components/_avatar.html.twig' with {initials: initials, size: 'md'} only %}
    {%- elseif lead == 'date' %}
        <span class="list-row__date"><span class="list-row__weekday">{{ date_weekday }}</span><span class="list-row__day">{{ date_day }}</span></span>
    {%- endif %}
    <span class="list-row__text">
        {%- if href %}<a class="list-row__title list-row__link" href="{{ href }}">{{ title }}</a>{% else %}<span class="list-row__title">{{ title }}</span>{% endif -%}
        {%- if meta %}<span class="list-row__meta list-row__meta--{{ meta_variant|default('default') }}">{{ meta }}</span>{% endif -%}
    </span>
    <span class="list-row__trailing">{% block row_trailing %}{% endblock %}</span>
    {%- if chevron %}<span class="list-row__chevron">{{ icon('chevron-right', null, 'icon--22') }}</span>{% endif %}
</li>
